{
  "name": "necromancer-voxel",
  "note": [
    "Rig for the depth-7 voxelizer output (necromancer.voxel7.glb), which is a",
    "coarser resample of the same character: 1.90 tall instead of 2.00, slightly",
    "narrower, and missing the tome and floating magic that --keep-largest and",
    "the voxel grid discarded. Colour lives in COLOR_0, not a texture.",
    "Joints read off orthographic renders. The character faces +Z, so its right",
    "hand is on -X and a negative local-X rotation swings a bone forward.",
    "No overrides are needed here \u2014 with no tome, nearest-bone is unambiguous."
  ],
